-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto text-lg\">Three phases. No setup fees. No surprises. Your entire first year online costs less than a single agency meeting.</p></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-24 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-center mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl px-6 py-3 shadow-lg\"><span class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">Full year 1 total:</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-black text-white\">$<!-- -->270</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm line-through\">$5,000+ agency</span><span class=\"bg-emerald-500 text-white text-[10px] font-black px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wide\">You save 98%</span></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><button class=\"text-left rounded-3xl border-2 p-6 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer w-full border-violet-200 bg-violet-50 shadow-lg\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br text-white from-violet-500 to-indigo-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hammer w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 12-9.373 9.373a1 1 0 0 1-3.001-3L12 9\"></path><path d=\"m18 15 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m21.5 11.5-1.914-1.914A2 2 0 0 1 19 8.172v-.344a2 2 0 0 0-.586-1.414l-1.657-1.657A6 6 0 0 0 12.516 3H9l1.243 1.243A6 6 0 0 1 12 8.485V10l2 2h1.172a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L18.5 14.5\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-violet-600\">Phase <!-- -->1</span></div><div class=\"mb-1\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-gray-900\">$100</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-medium text-sm\"> one time</span></div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 text-violet-600\">Month 1</p><p class=\"font-black text-gray-900 text-base mb-1\">We Build It</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-snug\">Your full website, designed and live in 48 hrs.</p><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-2 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4\" style=\"opacity:0;height:0px\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-gradient-to-br text-white from-violet-500 to-indigo-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>Custom design tailored to your brand</div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-gradient-to-br text-white from-violet-500 to-indigo-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>Built &amp; launched in 48 hours</div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-gradient-to-br text-white from-violet-500 to-indigo-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>Hosting, SSL, domain setup</div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 bg-gradient-to-br text-white from-violet-500 to-indigo-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-2.5 h-2.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></div>Mobile-optimized from day one</div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 italic pt-2 border-t border-gray-100\">Not a fee — this is the cost of us building your site. A freelancer charges $1,500+ for design alone.</p></div></button><button class=\"text-left rounded-3xl border-2 p-6 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer w-full border-gray-100 bg-white hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br text-white from-blue-500 to-cyan-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 7h6v6\"></path><path d=\"m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400\">Phase <!-- -->2</span></div><div class=\"mb-1\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-gray-900\">$40</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-medium text-sm\">/mo × 2</span></div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 text-gray-400\">Months 2–3</p><p class=\"font-black text-gray-900 text-base mb-1\">Watch It Work</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-snug\">Your site is live. Leads are coming in.</p></button><button class=\"text-left rounded-3xl border-2 p-6 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer w-full border-gray-100 bg-white hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br text-white from-emerald-500 to-teal-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-anchor w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v16\"></path><path d=\"m19 13 2-1a9 9 0 0 1-18 0l2 1\"></path><path d=\"M9 11h6\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400\">Phase <!-- -->3</span></div><div class=\"mb-1\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-black text-gray-900\">$10</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-medium text-sm\">/mo forever</span></div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 text-gray-400\">Month 4 onward</p><p class=\"font-black text-gray-900 text-base mb-1\">Cruise Mode</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-snug\">Runs itself. You just collect leads.</p></button></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center justify-center gap-0 mb-8 -mt-6\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"h-px w-32 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-violet-300 to-blue-300\"></div><div class=\"px-3 text-xs text-gray-400 font-semibold\">then</div><div class=\"h-px w-32 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-300 via-cyan-300 to-emerald-300\"></div><div class=\"px-3 text-xs text-gray-400 font-semibold\">then</div><div class=\"h-px w-32 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-300 via-teal-300 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 rounded-2xl p-5 text-white text-center shadow-xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart w-6 h-6 mx-auto mb-2 fill-red-300 text-red-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg><p class=\"font-bold leading-snug mb-1\">&quot;By month 4, most clients have already made their money back 10× over.&quot;</p><p class=\"text-blue-100 text-sm\">One new customer through your website = months of hosting paid for. We priced this so <em>every</em> local business can afford to start.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border-2 border-gray-100 shadow-xl bg-white overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 to-teal-500 px-8 py-3 flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold text-sm\">Your Phase 3 &quot;Cruise Mode&quot; rate — after month 3</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-anchor w-4 h-4 text-white/70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v16\"></path><path d=\"m19 13 2-1a9 9 0 0 1-18 0l2 1\"></path><path d=\"M9 11h6\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"4\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-gray-100\"><div class=\"flex-1 p-8 space-y-8\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400 mb-1\">How many pages?</p><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\"><span class=\"text-5xl font-black text-gray-900\">5</span><span class=\"text-gray-400 font-medium text-lg\">pages</span></div></div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl text-amber-700 text-sm font-bold\"><span class=\"text-lg\">☕</span>Less than a coffee a week</div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"49\" step=\"1\" class=\"w-full h-3 rounded-full appearance-none cursor-pointer\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, #10B981 0%, #14B8A6 8.16326530612245%, #E5E7EB 8.16326530612245%, #E5E7EB 100%)\" value=\"4\"/><style>\n                  input[type='range']::-webkit-slider-thumb {\n                    -webkit-appearance: none;\n                    width: 28px; height: 28px;\n                    background: #fff;\n                    border: 3px solid #10B981;\n                    border-radius: 50%;\n                    cursor: pointer;\n                    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(16,185,129,0.3);\n                  }\n                  input[type='range']::-moz-range-thumb {\n                    width: 26px; height: 26px;\n                    background: #fff;\n                    border: 3px solid #10B981;\n                    border-radius: 50%;\n                    cursor: pointer;\n                  }\n                </style><div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400 font-medium\"><span>1 page</span><span>50 pages</span></div></div><div class=\"bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-4 border border-gray-100 space-y-2\"><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3\">Your payment journey</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-violet-500\"></div><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 w-20 shrink-0\">Month 1</span><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 flex-1\">Site designed &amp; launched</span><span class=\"text-xs font-black text-gray-700\">$100</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-blue-500\"></div><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 w-20 shrink-0\">Months 2–3</span><span